create the wires
  aka support wires, support wire, wire, anchor wires, anchor wire, cable, cables, anchor cable, anchor cables, thick wires, braided wires
  scenery, plural
  in the Northwest Junction

  The wires anchor the support posts and hold the canvas awnings in place.

  when Jack moves, while among-the-wires
    move the wires here
